      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "迟迟不下雨啊～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FDF8FDF4E0D4E0B96E8554AFF5E00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "滴答滴答，滴答滴答……\n好棒的下雨天！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6EF47B546EF47B54FF0C6EF47B546EF47B5420262026000A597D68D276844E0B96E85929FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我说，你打宝可梦对战的时候\n在意过天气吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BF4FF0C4F6062535B9D53EF68A65BF96218768465F65019000A5728610F8FC759296C145417FF1F00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的宝可梦们\n在雨天可是很强的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845B9D53EF68A64EEC000A572896E8592953EF662F5F885F3A7684FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是下雨了，就来和我打一场吧。\n我会拿出真本事的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4E0B96E84E86FF0C5C316765548C621162534E00573A54273002000A62114F1A62FF51FA771F672C4E8B7684FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "趁着雨还没停，和我打一场吧。\n我会拿出真本事的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D81774096E88FD86CA1505CFF0C548C621162534E00573A54273002000A62114F1A62FF51FA771F672C4E8B7684FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "风雨无阻！\n你愿意对战的话，就来跟我说一声吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "98CE96E865E0963BFF01000A4F60613F610F5BF9621876848BDDFF0C5C3167658DDF62118BF44E0058F05427FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会让你见识到宝可梦们的亮眼之处的，\n所以要是下雨了，就来和我打一场吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n……咦？\n莫非你打算等到下雨？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A8BA94F6089C18BC652305B9D53EF68A64EEC76844EAE773C4E4B59047684FF0C000A62404EE58981662F4E0B96E84E86FF0C5C316765548C621162534E00573A5427FF0100100001BE01000A2026202654A6FF1F000A83AB975E4F6062537B977B4952304E0B96E8FF1F00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要等！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189817B49FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不等<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7B4900100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们趁着下雨打一场吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我会让你见识到\n宝可梦们的亮眼之处的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC8D8177404E0B96E862534E00573A5427300200100001BE01000A62114F1A8BA94F6089C18BC65230000A5B9D53EF68A64EEC76844EAE773C4E4B59047684FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让我见识见识！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA9621189C18BC689C18BC6FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "会被雨淋湿的<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F1A88AB96E86DCB6E7F768400100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样啊，\n的确没有等的理由……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD96837554AFF0C000A7684786E6CA167097B497684740675312026202600100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊？可是雨会停掉的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF1F53EF662F96E84F1A505C63897684FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦！你这么想和我打！？\n那就等下雨吧……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E6FF014F608FD94E4860F3548C62116253FF01FF1F000A90A35C317B494E0B96E854272026202600100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "下了！下雨了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0B4E86FF014E0B96E84E86FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的宝可梦学会的招式在雨天是最强的！\n见识一下水属性和雨天的组合吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845B9D53EF68A65B664F1A768462DB5F0F572896E85929662F67005F3A7684FF01000A89C18BC64E004E0B6C345C5E6027548C96E8592976847EC454085427FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水属性和雨天的组合\n也行不通啊……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C345C5E6027548C96E8592976847EC45408000A4E5F884C4E0D901A554A2026202600100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的宝可梦都学会了\n水属性的招式对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845B9D53EF68A690FD5B664F1A4E86000A6C345C5E6027768462DB5F0F5BF95427FF1F00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水属性的招式在雨天会变强！\n所以我以为自己能赢……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C345C5E6027768462DB5F0F572896E859294F1A53D85F3AFF01000A62404EE562114EE54E3A81EA5DF180FD8D622026202600100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC72026202600100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火属性的招式\n在雨天反而会变弱。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B5C5E6027768462DB5F0F000A572896E8592953CD800C4F1A53D85F31300200100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为会被雨淋湿，\n所以是理所当然的啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A4F1A88AB96E86DCB6E7FFF0C000A62404EE5662F740662405F53713676845566FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
